{"id":"herosplit","code":"<style>.hsp{width:340px;display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:center;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;padding:16px 10px}\n.hsp .tx{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:11px}\n.hsp h1{margin:0;color:var(--ink,#fff);font:700 20px Inter,sans-serif;line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-.02em}\n.hsp p{margin:0;color:var(--body,#B6BDC8);font:400 11px Inter,sans-serif;line-height:1.5}\n.hsp a{align-self:flex-start;background:var(--accent,#3366FF);color:#fff;font:700 12px Inter,sans-serif;padding:9px 18px;border-radius:99px;text-decoration:none}\n.hsp .img{width:135px;height:150px;border-radius:16px;border:1px solid var(--line,#262C34);background:linear-gradient(150deg,var(--accent-2,#7A5CFF),var(--accent,#3366FF));flex:none;position:relative;overflow:hidden}\n.hsp .img::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:14px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(11,14,19,.28);backdrop-filter:blur(2px)}</style>\n<div class=\"hsp\"><div class=\"tx\"><h1>Streamline your workflow with our platform</h1><p>Boost productivity, enhance collaboration and simplify your business processes.</p><a>Start free trial</a></div><div class=\"img\"></div></div>"}